# WNET.SCR - the script of WNET (TEST/WNET.C) against INVSERV in "make
# winnb": on the data TEST/KEYS/SEED.REQ seeds, HELLO, VER, a login and
# the item list, then a list of fifteen more items whose page, over
# NB_MSGMAX bytes, comes in two messages, and the end of the server.

> HELLO WINNB
< +OK
> VER
< +OK RETROINV 1.0
> LOGIN ADMIN Retro1986
< +OK LEVEL=3 NAME="System Administrator"
> ITEM LIST
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID CATEGORY MFR MODEL WORKS QTY AVAIL LOC_ID LOC_NAME STATUS
< R 1 SYS IBM 5150 Y 1 Y 1 Office A
< R 2 DRV Tandon TM100-2 N 2 Y 3 "Box B2" A
< R 3 CARD Hercules "Graphics Card" ? 1 Y 2 "Shelf A1" A
< .

> ITEM ADD CATEGORY=SYS MFR="Network Server Corporation" MODEL=NS-25 DESCR="Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" TAGS="network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup"
< +OK ID=4
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=5
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=6
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=7
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=8
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=9
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=10
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=11
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=12
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=13
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=14
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=15
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=16
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=17
> ITEM COPY 4
< +OK ID=18
> ITEM LIST FIELDS=ITEM_ID,MFR,DESCR,TAGS PAGE=25
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID MFR DESCR TAGS
< R 1 IBM "IBM Personal Computer" ""
< R 2 Tandon "" ""
< R 3 Hercules "" ""
< R 4 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 5 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 6 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 7 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 8 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 9 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 10 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 11 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 12 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 13 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 14 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 15 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 16 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 17 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< R 18 "Network Server Corporation" "Fifteen copies of this item make a page of over two KB" network,server,netbios,netbeui,session,listen,call,hangup
< .

> ADMIN SHUTDOWN
< +OK
